Why GPL: the download engine is
  io.github.junkfood02.youtubedl-android { library, ffmpeg } 0.18.1
which is GPL-3.0 and bundles a CPython runtime, yt-dlp and ffmpeg. Linking it makes this
application a covered work. yt-dlp itself is released under the Unlicense; the Python runtime,
ffmpeg and the Android support libraries carry their own licences.
